

### 8.12. Conical Functions

\[(P{{}_{-1}^{s}}_{+i\lambda}(\cos\,\theta),\,Q{{}_{-1+i\lambda}^{-}}(\cos\,\theta))\]

(Only special properties are given as other properties and representations follow from earlier sections with \(\nu\!=\!-\frac{1}{2}\!+\!\mathrm{i}\lambda\) (\(\lambda\), a real parameter) and z=\(\cos\,\theta\).)

12.1 \(P_{-1+\alpha}(\cos\,\theta)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!\int_{0}^{s}\frac{\cosh \lambda tdt}{\sqrt{2}\;(\cos\,t\!-\!\cos\,\theta)}\)

12.2 \(P_{-1+\alpha}(\cos\,\theta)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!\int_{0}^{s}\frac{\cosh \lambda tdt}{\sqrt{2}\;(\cos\,t\!-\!\cos\,\theta)}\)

12.4 \(Q_{-1+\pi\alpha}(\cos\,\theta)\!\!=\!\pm i\,\sinh\,\lambda\pi\!\int_{0}^{\ast} \frac{\cos\lambda tdt}{\sqrt{2}(\cos\,t\!+\!\cos\,\theta)}\)

.13.1 \(P_{-1}(z)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!\int_{0}^{z}\!\!\!K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{z-1}{z +1}}\right)\)

13.2 \(P_{-1}(\cosh\,\eta)\!\!=\!\!\left[\frac{\pi}{2}\cosh\frac{\eta}{2}\right]^{-1}\!\!\!K\!\left(\tanh\frac{\eta}{2}\right)\)

#### 8.13.3 \(Q_{-1}(z)\!\!=\!\!\sqrt{\frac{2}{z+1}}\,K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{2}{z+1}}\right)\)

#### 8.13.4 \(Q_{-1}(\cosh\,\eta)\!\!=\!\!2e^{-\,\eta/2}\!\!K\!\left(e^{-\,\eta}\right)\)

13.5 \(P_{-1}(z)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!\int_{0}^{s}\frac{\cosh\lambda tdt}{\sqrt{2} \;(\cos\,t\!-\!\cos\,\theta)}\)

#### 8.12.6 \(P_{1}(z)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!\int_{0}^{z}\!\!\!K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{2}{z+1}}\right)\)

#### 8.13.7 \(Q_{1}(z)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{2}{z+1}}\right)\)

#### 8.13.8 \(P_{-1}(z)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{2}{z+1}}\right)\)

#### 8.13.9 \(P_{-1}(\cos\,\theta)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!K\!\left(\sin\frac{\theta}{2}\right)\)

#### 8.13.10 \(Q_{-1}(x)\!\!=\!\!K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{1-x}{2}}\right)\)

13.11 \(P_{-1}(z)\!\!=\!\!\frac{2}{\pi}\!\sqrt{\frac{2}{z+1}}\,K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{z-1}{z +1}}\right)\)

13.12 \(Q_{1}(x)\!\!=\!\!K\!\left(\sqrt{\frac{1-x}{2}}\right)\!\!\to\!\!2E\left(\sqrt{ \frac{1-x}{2}}\right)\)

14.1 \(\int_{1}^{s}P_{s}(x)\!\!\,Q_{s}(x)\!\!\,dx\!\!=\!\![(\rho\!-\!\nu)(\rho\!+\! \nu\!+\!1)]^{-1}\!\!\![\,\!(\mathcal{R}\,\rho\!\!>\!\mathcal{R}\nu\!\!>\!0)\)